{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 面试攻略 MOC | 智能体开发工程师面试手册","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"薪资谈判技巧\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>guide\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"面试攻略\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> interview/salary\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/guide\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"面试攻略 MOC\" href=\"面试攻略 MOC\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试攻略 MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"智能体开发工程师面试手册\" href=\"智能体开发工程师面试手册\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">智能体开发工程师面试手册</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"薪资谈判技巧\" dir=\"auto\">薪资谈判技巧</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"一、薪资谈判的核心原则\" dir=\"auto\">一、薪资谈判的核心原则</h2>\n<pre class=\"language-mermaid\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-mermaid is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Error parsing Mermaid diagram!\n\nParse error on line 5:\n...   P2[\"📊 数据支撑&lt;br\"&gt;\"用市场数据说话\"]        P3\n-----------------------^\nExpecting 'SQE', 'DOUBLECIRCLEEND', 'PE', '-)', 'STADIUMEND', 'SUBROUTINEEND', 'PIPE', 'CYLINDEREND', 'DIAMOND_STOP', 'TAGEND', 'TRAPEND', 'INVTRAPEND', 'UNICODE_TEXT', 'TEXT', 'TAGSTART', got 'STR'</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"二、薪资调研\" dir=\"auto\">二、薪资调研</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"了解市场行情\" dir=\"auto\">了解市场行情</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>招聘网站</strong></td>\n<td>Boss 直聘、拉勾、猎聘上的薪资范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>薪酬报告</strong></td>\n<td>脉脉、猎聘发布的行业薪酬报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>同行交流</strong></td>\n<td>与同行朋友了解市场水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OfferShow</strong></td>\n<td>查看各公司各岗位的薪资爆料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"Agent 工程师薪资参考（2024-2025）\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 工程师薪资参考（2024-2025）</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>经验</th>\n<th>年薪范围（一线城市）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>初级</td>\n<td>0-2 年</td>\n<td>20-35 万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中级</td>\n<td>2-5 年</td>\n<td>35-60 万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高级</td>\n<td>5-8 年</td>\n<td>60-100 万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家</td>\n<td>8 年+</td>\n<td>100-150 万+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>以上为大厂/头部 AI 公司的参考范围，实际因公司、地域、个人背景差异较大。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"三、谈判时机\" dir=\"auto\">三、谈判时机</h2>\n<div class=\"mermaid\"><svg id=\"m617b672568f854d1\" width=\"1054.40625\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" class=\"flowchart\" height=\"164\" viewBox=\"0 0 1054.40625 164\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart-v2\"><style>#m617b672568f854d1{font-family:var(--font-mermaid);font-size:16px;fill:#333;}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 20s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#m617b672568f854d1 .error-icon{fill:#552222;}#m617b672568f854d1 .error-text{fill:#552222;stroke:#552222;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:1px;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-thickness-invisible{stroke-width:0;fill:none;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#m617b672568f854d1 .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#m617b672568f854d1 .marker{fill:#333333;stroke:#333333;}#m617b672568f854d1 .marker.cross{stroke:#3